### Goal Model Table

| Name | Text | Runtime | Goal Type | Target Condition/Enquired Information | Relation | Justification |
|------|------|---------|-----------|----------------------------------------|----------|---------------|
| G1   | Deliver food and retrieve dishes from inpatient rooms | - | Achieve | Food delivered and dishes retrieved | - | The mission requires the system to achieve the delivery and retrieval of dishes. |
| G2   | Deliver food to the inpatient room | - | Achieve | Food delivered to the correct inpatient | OR | The food can be delivered either by placing it on the table or by fetching from the tray. |
| G3   | Retrieve dirty dishes from the inpatient room | - | Achieve | Dishes retrieved from the room | OR | The dish retrieve can occur unassisted, with the cooperation of two robots, or with the cooperation of robots and a human. |
| G4   | Open the room door | - | Achieve | Door opened | OR | The door can be opened by a robot or by a human. |
| G2.1 | Deliver food to the room table | - | Achieve | Food placed on the room table | AND | The robot must navigate to the room and place the food on the table. |
| G2.2 | Fetch food from the robot's tray | - | Achieve | Food retrieved from the tray | AND | The robot must indicate the correct meal and track its retrieval. |
| G2.3 | Determine if the inpatient can retrieve food from the tray | - | Query | Can the inpatient retrieve food from the tray? | AND | The robot needs to query the inpatient's record to determine if they can retrieve the food. |
| G2.4 | Assist with food retrieval | - | Achieve | Food retrieved with assistance | AND | The robot must assist with food retrieval if the inpatient cannot retrieve it. |
| G3.1 | Retrieve dishes unassisted | - | Achieve | Dishes retrieved unassisted | AND | The robot can retrieve dishes without assistance. |
| G3.2 | Retrieve dishes with cooperation | - | Achieve | Dishes retrieved with cooperation | AND | The robot must cooperate with another robot or a human to retrieve the dishes. |
| G4.1 | Open the door with a robot | - | Achieve | Door opened by a robot | AND | A robot can open the door. |
| G4.2 | Open the door with a human | - | Achieve | Door opened by a human | AND | A human can open the door. |

