| AT3.2 | Retrieve dishes from the room | AND | Inpatient room | 1 | The robot must retrieve the dishes from the room. |
| AT3.3 | Cooperate with a human to retrieve dishes | AND | Inpatient room | 1 | The robot must cooperate with a human to retrieve the dishes. |
